7309+ 7B0B              ;send_ftp_command is the main routine that sends command+ string if needed and returns ftp answer code
7310+ 7B0B              ;IN=A=0=command only (eg. "ABORT"). A=1=comamnd+prepared string from INPUT (eg. "STOR filename"), A=2=command+new INPUT
